{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it, then process object. Move backwards if necessary, scan for object or randomly move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveBackward    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = RandomMovement    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinArmDistance    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsRobotAtOriginalPosition    />",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
